%%{init: {"theme": "neutral", "flowchart": {"wrappingWidth": 220}, "sequence": {"wrap": true, "width": 170, "useMaxWidth": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Thread A
    participant M as Mutex
    participant B as Thread B
    participant T as TSan runtime

    A->>M: Lock
    A->>A: Write shared value
    A->>T: Record the write
    A->>M: Unlock and publish logical time
    B->>M: Lock and acquire logical time
    B->>B: Read shared value
    B->>T: Record the read
    T->>T: Confirm write happens before read
    T-->>B: No data-race report
